{"id":"654018458","kind":"article","title":"数学概念有不同的心理表征，这对于制作数学探索媒介是个挑战","author":"Issa Rice","original_authors":["Issa Rice"],"original_source_urls":["https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Different_mental_representations_of_mathematical_objects_is_a_blocker_for_an_exploratory_medium_of_math"],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"Issawiki & Learning","date":"2023-09-05","updated":"2026-10-27","votes":5,"comment_count":0,"minutes":1,"chars":531,"keywords":["数学思维","心理表征","数学教育","探索式学习","Braid"],"summary":"译文指出，同一数学概念可能有多种截然不同的心理表征，熟练思考者需要在这些角度间切换。作者据此认为，面向数学的 Braid 若只在游戏化环境中实现一种表征，就会与单一思考路径过度耦合；他引用 Thurston、Michael Nielsen 和 Tim Gowers 的例子，说明数学理解常涉及从不同方式把握同一对象。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/654018458","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"T7j81q9L\">如果我们希望实现<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Braid_for_math\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">面向数学的 Braid</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>，我们要处理一大挑战：对于同一个数学概念，其思考角度可能截然不同（也就是说，同一概念有多种完全不同的心理表征）。熟练运用这个概念的人，通常需要不断在这些不同的思考方式之间切换。像<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/index.php?title=Video_game&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">游戏</a>中的谜题一样，只实现<b>一种</b>表征是不够的。</p><p data-pid=\"bmI4ROcu\">一些例子：</p><ul><li data-pid=\"zXfGooUE\"> 在《关于数学证明与发展》一文中，Thurston 网罗了各种各样的导数思考角度。<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"v26VwDfS\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Michael_Nielsen\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Michael Nielsen</a> 发过一条推文，讲的是很大一部分数学知识其实就在用各种方式来思考同一个数学概念。<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"0hy1apqo\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/index.php?title=Tim_Gowers&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Tim Gowers</a> 在<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://gowers.wordpress.com/2011/11/06/group-actions-i/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">这篇文章</a>的末尾写道，阶为 2n 的二面体群的思考方式有两种角度，一种是具体的，一种是抽象的。<br/> </li></ul><p data-pid=\"2I0BAclO\">我觉得这就让「面向数学的 Braid」更加困难了。假如你在一种类似游戏的环境中支持了某种表征，你实让游戏与这种思考方式深深耦合，过于强调这种特定角度了。</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"hf6kG6Ea\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>感谢主要译者 <span class=\"nolink\">S</span>hom、校对 Jarrett Ye<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Different_mental_representations_of_mathematical_objects_is_a_blocker_for_an_exploratory_medium_of_math\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Different mental representations of mathematical objects is a blocker for an exploratory medium of math</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 面向数学的《时空幻境》 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"715765481\" href=\"#/post/715765481\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"654018059","title":"定义压轴","author":"Issa Rice","votes":5,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · Issawiki & Learning"},{"id":"654018762","title":"数学头脑","author":"Issa Rice","votes":6,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · Issawiki & Learning"},{"id":"715765481","title":"面向数学的《时空幻境》","author":"Issa Rice","votes":16,"minutes":1,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"716414197","title":"对比数学与电子游戏","author":"Issa Rice","votes":16,"minutes":1,"reason":"延伸引用本文"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"1944442771533432041","title":"纠错练习","author":"Vipul","votes":8,"minutes":3,"reason":"跨学派视角 · Vipul"}],"rec_answers":[]}